# SCRLOAN.C: the lists of loans and holds, the Loans tab and the forms
# of its rows (MB_); the texts both clients show are SCRNFORM.MSG's.
# W=23 tab title, exactly, as MI_T_TABS
870 MB_T_TAB \x20Parts  Service [Loans]
